    <string name="onboarding_p1_title">Sitting creeps up on you</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p1_desc">SitBreak tracks how long you have been sitting and nudges you with a notification when it is time to move. Default interval is 45 minutes, fully adjustable.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p2_title">More than just a beep</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p2_desc">Besides stand reminders there are micro breaks, water and eye-rest reminders. Full-screen alerts stay out of the way while you game or watch videos.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p3_title">Your data never leaves this phone</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p3_desc">Check-ins are stored in a local database. No network, no upload, no account. Notification permission powers reminders, activity recognition verifies you actually stood up — both optional.</string>

